'''Chocolate Cat''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Chocolate Collaboration Event]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Chocolate Cat
|image = E 467.png
|appearance = [[Chocolate Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 5,000元 - 19,750元
}}

==Enemy==
Chocolate cat has relatively low stats, a 50% chance to knockback Cat Units and a massive money drop. Overall, this enemy serves a money bag and that only.

==Strategy==
Use meatshields along with Dragon Cat and Sexy Legs Cat to take it down easily.

